1
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,090
[Wu Ren, Ningcheng Police Station]

2
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:36,730
Master,

3
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,620
why

4
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,340
are you trying to kill me?

5
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,890
Once the student learns everything,
the master starves.

6
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:45,850
Look at all you've accomplished
at such a young age.

7
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,100
And now you want to take my place?

8
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:49,170
In your dreams.

9
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:01,830
Tianbail.

10
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:03,890
Rest easy.

11
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:18,920
Once the student learns everything,
the master starves.

12
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,720
And now you want to take my place?

13
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:22,590
In your dreams.

14
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:27,770
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 3]

15
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:29,910
A teacher

16
00:01:30,250 --> 00:01:31,490
is a father for life.

17
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,479
All these years,

18
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:37,250
I never once thought of taking his place.

19
00:01:38,229 --> 00:01:39,670
Yet he did that to me.

20
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,620
Wu Ren

21
00:01:41,710 --> 00:01:43,750
looks like an honorable man,

22
00:01:44,250 --> 00:01:46,650
but he's even more ruthless than we are.

23
00:01:49,009 --> 00:01:50,170
No wonder

24
00:01:50,190 --> 00:01:52,190
you're willing to join a gang

25
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:53,620
just to get your revenge.

26
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:54,720
But don't worry.

27
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,440
As long as you join our Shisha Gang,

28
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:59,590
killing Wu Ren

29
00:01:59,610 --> 00:02:01,530
would be easy.

30
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:02,740
However,

31
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:05,900
as long as that mole
in the Qingtian Gang is alive,

32
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:07,580
our Shisha Gang

33
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:11,150
will always have a weakness
in their hands.

34
00:02:12,730 --> 00:02:13,730
We've made a deal.

35
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,280
Find him

36
00:02:15,390 --> 00:02:16,390
and kill him.

37
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,820
Consider it your initiation.

38
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,760
Once you do that,

39
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,840
you'll be one of us.

40
00:02:24,990 --> 00:02:26,190
Don't worry, Mr. Hui.

41
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:27,980
I've got this.

42
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:31,720
Then I'll wait for your good news.

43
00:02:32,370 --> 00:02:33,500
When the time comes,

44
00:02:34,970 --> 00:02:36,850
don't go soft.

45
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:40,990
If he won't show me any loyalty...

46
00:02:43,650 --> 00:02:45,850
I won't show him any either.

47
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,950
[Lu Mansion]

48
00:02:48,990 --> 00:02:49,790
Young Master.

49
00:02:49,890 --> 00:02:52,490
Only the heads of our four branches

50
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:55,410
could have been poisoning
the old chief over time.

51
00:02:55,770 --> 00:02:56,510
You?

52
00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:57,940
No way.

53
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:00,900
Baihu died protecting the old man,

54
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:02,610
so we can rule him out, too.

55
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,810
That leaves only Qinglong and Zhuque.

56
00:03:04,810 --> 00:03:07,580
Find a chance to bring them in
and question them properly.

57
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:09,110
What if they refuse to come?

58
00:03:09,170 --> 00:03:10,250
It's not up to them.

59
00:03:11,940 --> 00:03:13,070
Give this to Zhuque.

60
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:16,850
Tell her I'll hand out
the gang leader's tokens.

61
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:18,800
She will definitely come.

62
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:21,540
I understand.

63
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:23,990
Although Zhuque has established
her own faction,

64
00:03:23,990 --> 00:03:25,790
she has always struggled
to win people over.

65
00:03:25,790 --> 00:03:27,390
If she has the chief's token,

66
00:03:27,490 --> 00:03:29,550
it'll help her establish some authority.

67
00:03:29,550 --> 00:03:30,350
Exactly.

68
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,220
With smart people,

69
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:35,070
it's better to win them over
with incentives.

70
00:03:35,070 --> 00:03:36,270
What about Qinglong?

71
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,800
Qinglong is a brute.

72
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,710
We'll have to force him.

73
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:41,230
The old man once told me

74
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:44,060
he kept a ledger in Master Qi's pawnshop.

75
00:03:44,130 --> 00:03:44,890
It records

76
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:47,180
all his shady dealings
with Ningcheng's top officials.

77
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:48,240
Once it's exposed,

78
00:03:48,450 --> 00:03:49,750
those people won't spare him.

79
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:50,590
I understand.

80
00:03:50,670 --> 00:03:52,790
You want to get the ledger from Master Qi

81
00:03:52,790 --> 00:03:54,920
and use it to force Qinglong to show up.

82
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:59,290
But Master Qi is not easy to deal with.

83
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:02,220
Even the old chief
got burned by him a few times.

84
00:04:02,950 --> 00:04:04,210
What are you afraid of?

85
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:06,060
I've got a secret weapon.

86
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:14,460
Miss.

87
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:16,120
This is a fine piece of jade.

88
00:04:16,230 --> 00:04:17,070
But...

89
00:04:17,550 --> 00:04:18,740
I can only offer this much.

90
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,800
Where is Master Qi?

91
00:04:21,339 --> 00:04:22,440
It's really unfortunate.

92
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,070
He is not here today.

93
00:04:24,090 --> 00:04:26,090
How about you come back another day?

94
00:04:26,690 --> 00:04:27,370
It's fine.

95
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:28,700
I'll wait for him.

96
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,110
I can only offer this much
for this jade...

97
00:04:31,110 --> 00:04:31,960
Please offer a little more.

98
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,580
This jade has
such beautiful color and clarity.

99
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,130
It's good enough to be a family heirloom.

100
00:04:35,130 --> 00:04:36,730
And you only offer this much?

101
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:39,700
I'll give you two silver dollars for it.

102
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:40,540
You...

103
00:04:40,909 --> 00:04:42,550
Thank you, Boss.

104
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,040
This watch...

105
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:47,800
This watch is a British brand too,
isn't it?

106
00:04:47,850 --> 00:04:49,450
It's gone up in value lately.

107
00:04:49,450 --> 00:04:50,860
It's worth 30 silver dollars.

108
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:51,820
What?

109
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:54,100
The shopkeeper said it's only worth
2 silver dollars.

110
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,140
You believe him?

111
00:04:55,210 --> 00:04:57,530
I am the shopkeeper.

112
00:04:57,550 --> 00:04:59,180
He's Young Master Lu
of the Qingtian Gang.

113
00:04:59,180 --> 00:05:00,540
He has seen so many good things.

114
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:01,480
He definitely knows his stuff.

115
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,990
I'm not selling this watch anymore.

116
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:03,380
You...

117
00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:05,340
What a lousy pawnshop.

118
00:05:05,530 --> 00:05:08,160
They prey on people
when they're desperate for money.

119
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,040
Come and take a look, everyone!

120
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:10,950
Lu Ye.

121
00:05:10,970 --> 00:05:12,490
What exactly do you want?

122
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:15,980
Master Qi.

123
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:17,740
You're finally willing to see me.

124
00:05:17,740 --> 00:05:19,510
[Master Qi, Ningcheng Pawnshop]

125
00:05:25,150 --> 00:05:25,950
Master Qi.

126
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:28,940
I heard Qinglong left a ledger with you.

127
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:31,250
He's been using my old man's name

128
00:05:31,250 --> 00:05:32,710
to cause trouble everywhere.

129
00:05:32,710 --> 00:05:35,970
The Qingtian Gang should be the ones
handling this ledger.

130
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,360
Qingtian Gang?

131
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:39,570
What a joke.

132
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:42,620
Does the Qingtian Gang even exist anymore?

133
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,909
Young Master Lu.

134
00:05:43,909 --> 00:05:45,310
I'll give you one chance.

135
00:05:45,530 --> 00:05:47,370
Walk out of here on your own.

136
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:48,210
Fine.

137
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:51,780
It seems you're determined
not to give it to me.

138
00:05:51,890 --> 00:05:52,890
So what if I am?

139
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:54,540
Let me make this clear.

140
00:05:54,570 --> 00:05:57,370
If you've got the guts,
send the cops to come get it.

141
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,450
Are you serious?

142
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:15,380
Hand it over.

143
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,560
Officer...

144
00:06:17,590 --> 00:06:18,470
Officer Shen.

145
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,600
How did you...

146
00:06:20,790 --> 00:06:23,070
Is this how you treat your guests?

147
00:06:23,470 --> 00:06:25,400
My servants don't know any better.

148
00:06:29,770 --> 00:06:30,430
Let me do it.

149
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,520
Master Qi.

150
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:53,780
What about the ledger?

151
00:07:01,170 --> 00:07:02,920
Sure, we can work something out.

152
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,720
But I need to look for it.

153
00:07:04,930 --> 00:07:05,590
No problem.

154
00:07:06,850 --> 00:07:08,870
I'll just have a little chat
with your wife.

155
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:10,150
I wonder

156
00:07:10,370 --> 00:07:13,630
if she knows about your illegitimate child
in the suburbs.

157
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:14,620
Don't...

158
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,570
Young Master Lu.

159
00:07:15,650 --> 00:07:16,980
I'll go get it right now.

160
00:07:25,670 --> 00:07:27,530
[Ledger]

161
00:07:31,250 --> 00:07:31,930
Alright.

162
00:07:31,950 --> 00:07:33,350
I won't bother you then.

163
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:34,180
Tianbai!

164
00:07:41,590 --> 00:07:42,909
Why is he here?

165
00:07:47,690 --> 00:07:49,409
You brat.

166
00:07:49,650 --> 00:07:51,450
You made me lose face.

167
00:07:51,930 --> 00:07:54,260
Don't think I'll let you off easy, either.

168
00:07:56,650 --> 00:07:57,870
Here we go.

169
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,320
Tianbai.

170
00:08:01,350 --> 00:08:02,440
I'm glad you're okay.

171
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,960
I was so worried about you.

172
00:08:07,660 --> 00:08:08,350
Lu Ye.

173
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:10,150
What did you do to him?

174
00:08:12,860 --> 00:08:14,020
Officer Wu.

175
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,200
Calm down.

176
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,040
Look.

177
00:08:16,450 --> 00:08:18,800
He's standing right in front of you,
isn't he?

178
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,660
I won't let you get away with this.

179
00:08:20,810 --> 00:08:22,010
I swear to God

180
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:23,390
I didn't harm him.

181
00:08:23,970 --> 00:08:24,910
At least...

182
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,160
I didn't throw him into the fire,

183
00:08:28,850 --> 00:08:30,290
steal his credit,

184
00:08:30,490 --> 00:08:32,890
and use him as a stepping stone
to get ahead.

185
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:35,179
Tianbai.

186
00:08:36,929 --> 00:08:37,990
Don't believe him.

187
00:08:38,130 --> 00:08:39,450
He is your sworn enemy.

188
00:08:39,470 --> 00:08:40,470
He is lying to you.

189
00:08:40,809 --> 00:08:41,610
Right.

190
00:08:41,789 --> 00:08:42,590
Look.

191
00:08:43,309 --> 00:08:44,770
This is your police badge.

192
00:08:45,180 --> 00:08:45,780
Come on.

193
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:46,800
Go back with me.

194
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:49,990
I will help you remember slowly.

195
00:08:50,490 --> 00:08:51,290
Is it okay?

196
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,290
It seems

197
00:08:54,850 --> 00:08:57,310
he really thinks
I don't remember anything.

198
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,430
Why are you looking at me?

199
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:05,590
It's up to you.

200
00:09:05,850 --> 00:09:07,650
If you want to leave, then leave.

201
00:09:22,210 --> 00:09:23,140
I don't know you.

202
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,360
You should leave.

203
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:28,540
Lu Ye!

204
00:09:33,220 --> 00:09:34,460
Tianbai, you...

205
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,760
Take one more step,

206
00:09:35,940 --> 00:09:37,580
and I won't hold back.

207
00:09:40,370 --> 00:09:41,250
All right.

208
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:44,030
Don't scare Officer Wu.

209
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:46,300
Put it down.

210
00:09:55,710 --> 00:09:57,620
[Ningcheng Police Station]

211
00:09:58,110 --> 00:09:59,710
Shen Tianbai,

212
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,860
you're actually still alive.

213
00:10:17,650 --> 00:10:20,490
I'll find a way to finish you off.

214
00:10:26,660 --> 00:10:28,250
[See you at the train station at 4 p.m.
Come alone. ]

215
00:10:28,250 --> 00:10:29,850
[Otherwise, you'll be collecting
Lu Ye's body in 3 days.]

216
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:50,580
Young Master,

217
00:10:50,930 --> 00:10:51,530
we've got a problem.

218
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:52,670
Shen Tianbai has gone out.

219
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:53,470
What?

220
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,860
He went to the train station.

221
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:57,490
Our people said Wu Ren
asked him to meet him there.

222
00:10:57,490 --> 00:10:58,120
Let's go.

223
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:01,520
There really is something going on
between them.

224
00:11:14,410 --> 00:11:15,270
Shen Tianbai,

225
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:16,360
you won't get away.

226
00:11:17,590 --> 00:11:18,510
I knew

227
00:11:18,970 --> 00:11:20,500
you would definitely come.

228
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:27,630
Young Master,

229
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:28,360
he's inside.

230
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:31,900
Don't forget

231
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:33,250
I taught you all of this.

232
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,520
Go to hell!

233
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:59,970
[Ningcheng Train Station]

234
00:11:57,700 --> 00:11:58,500
After him!

235
00:12:06,430 --> 00:12:07,560
Are you still alive?

236
00:12:09,190 --> 00:12:10,110
Young Master.

237
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:13,260
Why did you come here?

238
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:20,290
Because of this.

239
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,050
See you at the train station at 4 p.m.

240
00:12:26,050 --> 00:12:26,970
Come alone.

241
00:12:27,010 --> 00:12:27,670
Otherwise,

242
00:12:27,690 --> 00:12:29,820
you'll be collecting Lu Ye's body
in 3 days.

243
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:31,150
You did it just for this?

244
00:12:33,730 --> 00:12:35,330
Do you have any brains at all?

245
00:12:36,370 --> 00:12:37,650
He wanted to kill you.

246
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:38,410
Did you think about...

247
00:12:38,410 --> 00:12:39,470
I couldn't risk it.

248
00:12:41,890 --> 00:12:42,800
I couldn't

249
00:12:43,850 --> 00:12:45,490
risk your life

250
00:12:58,700 --> 00:12:59,760
It's getting late.

251
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,400
Let's go home.

252
00:13:02,270 --> 00:13:02,980
Yes.

253
00:13:24,180 --> 00:13:24,980
Lu Ye,

254
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:27,120
you've tested me so many times.

255
00:13:27,650 --> 00:13:28,530
This time,

256
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:31,130
you should finally believe me.

257
00:13:58,520 --> 00:13:59,320
Young Master,

258
00:13:59,660 --> 00:14:01,700
do you really trust Shen Tianbai?

259
00:14:02,990 --> 00:14:03,990
What do you think?

260
00:14:05,470 --> 00:14:06,350
You...

261
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:07,800
You still don't trust him.

262
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:08,960
If so,

263
00:14:08,990 --> 00:14:10,150
why did you save him?

264
00:14:10,730 --> 00:14:11,550
Because

265
00:14:11,990 --> 00:14:13,630
I want him to trust me.

266
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:17,360
The night is still young.
